title":"Öngörü","tagline":null,"description":"سيلين امرأة تتمتع بقدرة استثنائية على رؤية مستقبل الآخرين في أحلامها. عازمة على استخدام هذه الموهبة لتغيير حياتها ومصير من حولها، تجد نفسها فجأة منجذبة إلى قصة حب خطيرة. عندما تلتقي بكمال، تشتعل بينهما شرارة من الشغف والخطر، مما يجبر سيلين على اتخاذ قرارات ستحدد مصيرهما معًا.","description_en":"Selen is a woman with the extraordinary ability to foresee other people’s futures in her dreams. Determined to use this gift to change her own life and the fate of those around her, she unexpectedly finds herself drawn into a dangerous love story. When she crosses paths with a man, Kemal, their connection sparks both passion and peril, forcing Selen to make choices that will shape both of their destinies.","description_fr":"Selen a le don de voir l'avenir dans ses rêves. Après des années à changer le destin d'inconnus, elle rêve de sa propre mort aux côtés d'un homme qui essaie de la sauver. Lorsqu'elle rencontre Kemal, l'homme de sa vision, destin et romance s'entremêlent. Partagée entre la peur et le désir, Selen s'embarque dans une aventure où l'amour et le danger sont indissociables. L'éveil de ses sentiments pourrait bien lui révéler la réponse qu'elle cherche.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vrz4hRXWs44YBEMH7qTbzjuoOol.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1lN0J2L4j0U2gtwZtfjET5tYbtc.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":7.3,"vote_count":20,"age_rating":"R","year":"2026","release_date":"2026-08-28","runtime_minutes":96,"status":"Released","country":"تركيا","language":"التركية","genres":["دراما","رومنسية"],"genre_keys":["drama","romance"],"similar":["mv194","mv271954","mv603661","mv859","mv243","mv9390","mv445651","mv330493"],"director":"Ali Bilgin","cast":[{"name":"هلال التنبيلك","character":"Selen","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hRR5QT5OP5ivyJdLyeOpyVRbfgs.jpg"},{"name":"Serkan Çayoğlu","character":"Kemal","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ryi7hQzOvxEzuy2Vr7DC378LlhR.jpg"},{"